OL,3,AHousehunter swaps Australia for Wales's
OL,4,Amost affordable town - where locals are
OL,5,Astruggling to buy
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut some people who live in Ferndale -
OL,8,Fdubbed Wales' most affordable town with
OL,9,Fan average property price of #116,200 -
OL,10,Fsay they are still struggling to buy
OL,11,Fhomes.
